0..65 Comment "// A data declaration in a module body is a member of the module."
66..68 Comment "//"
69..146 Comment "// A module groups a family with the functions over it, so the family belongs"
147..195 Comment "// beside its functions under the module\'s name."
196..198 Comment "//"
199..274 Comment "// The collection admits the family into the module\'s container. Inside the"
275..353 Comment "// module, its name and its constructors stand bare. Outside it, `M.Box` names"
354..429 Comment "// the family. `M.B` names its constructor in a value and in a pattern, and"
430..463 Comment "// `M.Box.B` names it in a value."
464..466 Comment "//"
467..482 Comment "// - see: #4298"
